</table></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Success rates of imitation learning methods on the Humanoid Everyday Dataset.</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
